  "notes": "{戻|もど}す is a godan verb meaning to return something or put it back. It also has a secondary meaning of \"to vomit\" (euphemistic).\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Pair: ⟦{戻|もど}る→戻る：01117_modoru⟧ (intransitive: to return, go back)\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- ⟦{元|もと}→元：03878_moto⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{戻|もど}す: to restore to original state\n- ⟦{話|はなし}→話：01496_hanashi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{戻|もど}す: to get back to the topic\n- ⟦{巻|ま}き{戻|もど}す→巻き戻す：15915_makimodosu⟧: to rewind\n- ⟦{初期|しょき}→初期：11742_shoki⟧⟦{設定|せってい}→設定：04767_settei⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{戻|もど}す: to reset to default\n\nSECONDARY MEANING:\nUsed euphemistically for \"to vomit\": ⟦{飲|の}みすぎて→飲む：00322_nomu⟧{戻|もど}した (I drank too much and threw up).",
